                <pb facs="0703" n="603" sameAs="frus:frus1934v02/pg603"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.65/103: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-10T16:00:00-05:00">April 10, 1934—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your 56, April 9, Noon. Pending receipt of further instructions following
                    arrival of Italian draft treaty you may withhold action on Department’s 24,
                    April 5, 1 P.M.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
